Package: TwoSampleCalImpute
Type: Package
Title: Two-Sample Calibrated Imputation for Survey Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Samuel Joel Kamun", email = "samuelkamun@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides computational implementations of the Two-Sample Calibrated Imputation framework for incomplete survey data when auxiliary information is available from a separate reference sample. The package supports data preparation, survey design specification, calibration, imputation, estimation, variance estimation, diagnostics, reporting, and reproducible analytical workflows.
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
License: GPL (>= 3)
